"It was a Night Order facility: luxurious warded rooms above, a steampunk lab below."
"Gear-hinged metal doors with key slots led into the lab."
"The lab held specimen jars, caged corrupted monsters and a pool of living black ichor."
"The Order threw corrupting stone slabs from the island into the merfolk's seas."
"Cee and Renir sank it; Lucien was last seen fighting there, and likely lives."
"Liora killed lab guards Anton and Bert; the ichor left an orb she keeps unexamined."
